WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.025
A function is a named job. Making it does not run it.

2
00:00:04.802 --> 00:00:07.852
A call block runs it, once for each call.

3
00:00:10.345 --> 00:00:15.270
The timer calls spawn bug every second, so a bug appears every second.

4
00:00:16.151 --> 00:00:20.301
Every event block is a function too. The game calls it for you.
